<|SECTION:TASK|>
The owner describes a new place, group or person for their fantasy world. Their words name these languages of the world:
{% for language in languages -%}
- {{ language.name }}{% if language.about %}: {{ language.about }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
For each of these languages, say how the new entry uses it, from the owner's words only:
- a role: {{ roles|join(", ") }};
- a share from 0 to 1 when more than one is spoken, the shares adding to about 1.
Most entries have one main language. Use only the languages listed.

The owner's words: {{ prompt }}
<|CLOSE_SECTION|>
<|SECTION:FORMAT|>
Reply with only one JSON object, shaped exactly like this example:
{"languages": [{"language": "Moscavian", "role": "official", "share": 1}]}

No commentary, no markdown fences, just the JSON object.
<|CLOSE_SECTION|>
